	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  pg_ctl status sous Windows ne voit le serveur]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=31480#p31480"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Contenu du pg_env.bat (créé par l&#039;installer d&#039;EDB) :<br />@ECHO OFF<br />REM The script sets environment variables helpful for PostgreSQL</p><p>@SET PATH=&quot;C:\Program Files\PostgreSQL\11\bin&quot;;%PATH%<br />@SET PGDATA=C:\Program Files\PostgreSQL\11\data<br />@SET PGDATABASE=postgres<br />@SET PGUSER=postgres<br />@SET PGPORT=5432<br />@SET PGLOCALEDIR=C:\Program Files\PostgreSQL\11\share\locale</p>]]></content>
